cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If fwtriage helped your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fwtriage: evidence-first security triage for firmware images"
authors:
  - family-names: Florentino
    given-names: Augusto
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/augustoflorentino/fwtriage"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-02-07
keywords:
  - firmware
  - embedded security
  - SBOM
  - SARIF
abstract: >-
  fwtriage unpacks router, camera and embedded firmware images in memory,
  reports what is inside, and grades findings on accounts, secrets, services,
  components, binary hardening and image signing, each with the evidence
  needed to reproduce it.
